  "cost": 0,
  "interpretation": "<ul data-start=\"551\" data-end=\"1025\">\n<li data-start=\"551\" data-end=\"655\">\n<p data-start=\"553\" data-end=\"655\"><span style=\"font-size: 9px;\"><strong data-start=\"553\" data-end=\"562\">SOX10</strong> is a nuclear transcription factor involved in the development of neural crest-derived cells.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 9px;\" data-start=\"656\" data-end=\"814\">\n<p data-start=\"658\" data-end=\"680\"><span style=\"font-size: 9px;\">Commonly expressed in:</span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"683\" data-end=\"814\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 9px;\" data-start=\"683\" data-end=\"728\">\n<p data-start=\"685\" data-end=\"728\"><span style=\"font-size: 9px;\"><strong data-start=\"685\" data-end=\"707\">Melanocytic tumors</strong> (e.g., <strong data-start=\"715\" data-end=\"727\">melanoma</strong>)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 9px;\" data-start=\"731\" data-end=\"767\">\n<p data-start=\"733\" data-end=\"767\"><span style=\"font-size: 9px;\"><strong data-start=\"733\" data-end=\"748\">Schwannomas</strong>, <strong data-start=\"750\" data-end=\"767\">neurofibromas</strong></span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 9px;\" data-start=\"770\" data-end=\"814\">\n<p data-start=\"772\" data-end=\"814\"><span style=\"font-size: 9px;\">Some <strong data-start=\"777\" data-end=\"814\">triple-negative breast carcinomas</strong></span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 9px;\" data-start=\"815\" data-end=\"935\">\n<p data-start=\"817\" data-end=\"869\"><span style=\"font-size: 9px;\"><strong data-start=\"817\" data-end=\"846\">Positive nuclear staining</strong> supports diagnosis of:</span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"872\" data-end=\"935\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 9px;\" data-start=\"872\" data-end=\"896\">\n<p data-start=\"874\" data-end=\"896\"><span style=\"font-size: 9px;\"><strong data-start=\"874\" data-end=\"896\">Malignant melanoma</strong></span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 9px;\" data-start=\"899\" data-end=\"935\">\n<p data-start=\"901\" data-end=\"935\"><span style=\"font-size: 9px;\"><strong data-start=\"901\" data-end=\"935\">Peripheral nerve sheath tumors</strong></span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 9px;\" data-start=\"936\" data-end=\"1025\">\n<p data-start=\"938\" data-end=\"1025\"><span style=\"font-size: 9px;\">Useful in differentiating <strong data-start=\"964\" data-end=\"1024\">melanocytic tumors from epithelial or mesenchymal tumors</strong>.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
